        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Brass Accents D09-D0240 Palladian Collection Single Cylinder Deadbolt</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Palladian Single Cylinder Deadbolt is a timeless masterpiece inspired by the elegance of Palladian architecture. With its traditional arched design elements, this deadbolt adds a touch of grandeur to any standard door. Crafted with attention to detail, it seamlessly fits door standard door preparations, providing secure access with a key-operated exterior cylinder. The smooth thumb turn on the interior ensures effortless locking and unlocking. Elevate your door's appeal with the Palladian Single Cylinder Deadbolt and experience the perfect blend of tradition and functionality.  For doors that are 1-3/4 inches thick with either 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Single Cylinder:</b> The deadbolt is thrown and retracted by a key from exterior and by a thumb turn from the interior\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Traditional Palladian Door Lock:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Plate Width: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Height: 4-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: adjustable for 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Keyway: Schlage C</li>\r\n<li>Will fit standard 2-1/8\" door preparations.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
